##
## Synthetic fixture for testing dynamic heredoc terminator capture.
## Uses END as the heredoc terminator instead of EOC to verify the parser
## discovers the terminator name from the opening line dynamically.
##
$the_cow = <<END;
    $thoughts  ,_---~~~~~----._
  _,,_,*^____      _____``*g*\\",
 / __/ /'     ^.  /      \ ^@q   f
[  @f | @))    |  | @))   l  0 _/
 \\`/   \\~____ / __ \_____/    \
  |        $eyes        |
  |         $tongue          |
END
